    "summary": "**[[HAZARDOUS]](vsdata:core-rule/hazardous)** weapons generate **[Hazard Rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls)** for the unit. When any of those rolls fail, resolve the resulting damage using **[Mortal Wounds (06.02)](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**. A model can receive the damage regardless of whether it carries one of those weapons.",
